# AI Lead Qualification & Follow-Up System

## Overview
An automated workflow that captures leads,
qualifies them using AI, and sends personalized
follow-up messages.

## Problem
Businesses lose potential customers because
new leads aren't contacted quickly.

## Solution
[diagram/screenshot]

## Workflow
1. Lead enters through form
2. Webhook receives information
3. AI analyzes the lead
4. Lead is categorized
5. CRM is updated
6. Personalized email is sent
7. Sales team receives notification

## Tech Stack
- n8n
- OpenAI API
- Google Sheets
- Gmail API
- CRM API

